<title>BELGIUM: Dutch Hema to buy GIB's Sarma - paper.</title>
<headline>Dutch Hema to buy GIB's Sarma - paper.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch department store group Hema is to buy Belgian department chain Sarma from Belgian retail group GIB, De Financieel Economische Tijd newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hema, or  Hollandsche Eenheidsprijzen Maatschappij, is a unit of the Netherlands' Koninklijke Bijenkorf Beheer NV, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Hema has four stores in Belgium while Sarma has 27, it said.</p>
<p>The newspaper did not give any financial details.</p>
